        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "For Petitioners  in both Crl.O.Ps : Mr. R. G. Narendhiran",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 966,
      "end": 1025,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "R. G. Narendhiran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1006,
          "end": 1023
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "For Respondent : Ms. M.F. Shabana, G.A (Crl.Side)\n in both Crl.O.Ps  O R D E R",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1025,
      "end": 1105,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "M.F. Shabana",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1046,
          "end": 1058
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The petitioners have come forward with these two petitions seeking to quash the complaint in C.C.\nNo.170/09 on the file of the Judicial Magistrate-I, Tiruppur District and C.C. Nos.189/09 on the file of the Judicial Magistrate-I, Pollachi.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1105,
      "end": 1344,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.C.\nNo.170/09",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1198,
          "end": 1212
        },
        {
          "text": "Judicial Magistrate-I, Tiruppur District",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1232,
          "end": 1272
        },
        {
          "text": "C.C. Nos.189/09",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1277,
          "end": 1292
        },
        {
          "text": "Judicial Magistrate-I, Pollachi",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1312,
          "end": 1343
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12197384983301163
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "2. According to the petitioners, the 4th petitioner M/s. Lion Dates Impex is a Private Limited company, engaged in purchasing and selling dates, under the name and style \u0013Lion\u0014.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1346,
      "end": 1523,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Lion Dates Impex",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1403,
          "end": 1419
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2527697682380676
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "They are also in the manufacture of Lion Dates Syrup.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1524,
      "end": 1577,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20535606145858765
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The Officials, under the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954, collected samples on 27.07.2007 and 28.07.2007 and sent for analysis.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1578,
      "end": 1715,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1603,
          "end": 1644
        },
        {
          "text": "27.07.2007",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1667,
          "end": 1677
        },
        {
          "text": "28.07.2007",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1682,
          "end": 1692
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4116932451725006
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Though the respondents have received the report on 31.08.2007 and 06.09.2007 the complaint has been given only on 18.05.2009.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1716,
      "end": 1841,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "31.08.2007",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1767,
          "end": 1777
        },
        {
          "text": "06.09.2007",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1782,
          "end": 1792
        },
        {
          "text": "18.05.2009",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1830,
          "end": 1840
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19817568361759186
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "3. According to the learned counsel for the petitioners, the entire packing is done with the supervision of the Quality Controller and they have been complying with the provisions under the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1843,
      "end": 2075,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2033,
          "end": 2074
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3085165321826935
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "It is further submitted that complaints have been erroneously given by the Officials, under the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2076,
      "end": 2214,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2172,
          "end": 2213
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30297091603279114
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "The complaints have been filed before the Judicial Magistrate -I, Tirupur and the Judicial Magistrate -I,\nPollachi.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2215,
      "end": 2330,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Judicial Magistrate -I, Tirupur",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2257,
          "end": 2288
        },
        {
          "text": "Judicial Magistrate -I,\nPollachi",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2297,
          "end": 2329
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4027695953845978
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "The complaint against the petitioners, for the offences said to have been committed under Section 16(1)(a)(i) r/w 7(ii) & Section 2(ix) (K) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act 1954 and Rule 36(7)(a) of the PFA Rules, 1955.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2331,
      "end": 2556,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 16(1)(a)(i) r",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2421,
          "end": 2442
        },
        {
          "text": "w 7(ii)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2443,
          "end": 2450
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 2(ix) (K)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2453,
          "end": 2470
        },
        {
          "text": "Prevention of Food Adulteration Act 1954",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2474,
          "end": 2514
        },
        {
          "text": "Rule 36(7)(a)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2519,
          "end": 2532
        },
        {
          "text": "PFA Rules, 1955",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2540,
          "end": 2555
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.526434063911438
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "4. As per Section 11(4) of the Act, the respondents should have taken action within seven days on receipt of the report, but only after two years, the respondents have filed the complaints against the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2558,
      "end": 2771,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 11(4)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2568,
          "end": 2581
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.49509671330451965
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "Taking note of the decision of this Court, in the case of Selvakumar vs. State reported in 2010(2) FAC 304, this Court is inclined to accept the contention of the learned counsel for the petitioners and quash the proceedings only on the ground of laches.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PRE_RELIED",
      "start": 2772,
      "end": 3026,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Selvakumar vs. State reported in 2010(2) FAC 304",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2830,
          "end": 2878
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.296610563993454
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "If there are any further complaints, it is open to the respondents to proceed on merits, in accordance with law.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3027,
      "end": 3139,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4104010760784149
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "5. In view of the above, both the Criminal Original Petitions are allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3140,
      "end": 3215,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19123031198978424
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Consequently, the connected M.Ps are closed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3216,
      "end": 3260,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
